  "description": "Stock quote and price-history client for Oktaf sites (Marketstack end-of-day prices). Follows the Oktaf client pattern: IStockClient over GenericClient, a StockClientConfig section, and a bootstrap. Snapshots are cached in memory, and the last good one is served while Marketstack is failing. Needs StockClient:AccessKey.",
